nterpretations, is the same: AWARENESS. Conscious choice about what you consume, what you react to, and what quality of energy you generate.\n\nThat's what shadow work does. That's what meditation does. That's what ERSS does. That's what this entire curriculum does.\n\nStop being an unconscious crop. Start being a conscious gardener."),
